WEBVTT

00:03:55.268 --> 00:04:00.699
asking this world to dance, 
even if it keeps stepping on my holy feet

00:04:00.699 --> 00:04:03.767
you- you stay here with me, okay?

00:04:03.767 --> 00:04:05.448
You stay here with me.

00:04:05.448 --> 00:04:08.308
Raising your bite against the bitter dark

00:04:08.308 --> 00:04:09.537
Your bright longing

00:04:09.537 --> 00:04:11.827
Your brilliant fists of loss

00:04:11.827 --> 00:04:12.798
Friend

00:04:12.798 --> 00:04:16.048
if the only thing we have to gain
in staying is each other,

00:04:16.048 --> 00:04:17.947
my god that’s plenty

00:04:17.947 --> 00:04:19.617
my god that’s enough

00:04:19.617 --> 00:04:22.596
my god that is so so much
for the light to give

00:04:22.596 --> 00:04:28.127
each of us at each other’s backs
whispering over and over and over

00:04:28.127 --> 00:04:28.857
“Live”

00:04:29.257 --> 00:04:30.199
“Live”